    "faq": {
      "heading": "Frequently asked questions",
      "items": [
        {
          "q": "Do I need special hardware?",
          "a": "No. The system runs in a browser on any computer, and the mobile app turns an ordinary smartphone into a barcode scanner. IoT temperature sensors are an optional module you can add if you want."
        },
        {
          "q": "How long does setup take?",
          "a": "Usually a few business days: we configure the system for your store, import your product range, and train your team. For a chain with multiple locations, we agree on a timeline separately."
        },
        {
          "q": "Does it work with fiscal registrars (ПРРО)?",
          "a": "Yes. Built-in integration with Checkbox: fiscal receipts, opening and closing shifts, Z-reports. Every sale automatically deducts stock following FEFO."
        },
        {
          "q": "I have multiple stores — is that supported?",
          "a": "Yes, the system is built for chains from the ground up: each location is tracked separately, transfers between stores are recorded as documents, and consolidated analytics show the whole chain on one screen."
        },
        {
          "q": "Is my data secure?",
          "a": "Yes. Connections are encrypted (HTTPS/TLS), each customer's data is isolated at the database level, access is protected by two-factor authentication (2FA), and backups run regularly."
        },
        {
          "q": "Can I work from my phone?",
          "a": "Yes. The mobile app covers day-to-day operations: scanning, receiving deliveries, write-offs, stocktaking, and even checkout. Managers see the dashboard and notifications right on their phone."
        }
      ]
    },
